#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:5
#: f39aec39292c4fd892cd85ec7cfe1f36
msgid "Setting Home and/or EKF origin"
msgstr "设置 Home 位置和/或 EKF 原点"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:7
#: 86d52a7ff55d4ed9837acccc57d729e7
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used by a ground station or companion "
"computer to get or set the home or EKF origin."
msgstr "本页说明地面站或伴随计算机如何使用 MAVLink 获取或设置 Home 位置或 EKF 原点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:10
#: faf205f61d164042ac2a38683f10907c
msgid "Home vs EKF Origin"
msgstr "Home 位置与 EKF 原点的区别"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:12
#: cb15f4c4f755457a8d11005e34d14a73
msgid ""
"The vehicles \"Home\" position is the location (specified as a latitude, "
"longitude and altitude above sea level) that the vehicle will return to in "
":ref:`RTL <copter:rtl-mode>` mode.  For most vehicles this location is set "
"to the vehicle's current location each time the vehicle is armed but it may "
"also be moved at any time.  Moving home can be useful in situations where "
"the user wishes RTL mode to return the vehicle to a different location than "
"it took off from."
msgstr ""
"飞行器的「Home」位置是飞行器在 :ref:`RTL <copter:rtl-mode>` "
"模式下将返回的地点（以纬度、经度和海拔高度表示）。对于大多数飞行器，每次解锁时该位置将被设置为当前位置，但也可随时更改。在用户希望 RTL "
"模式返回到与起飞点不同位置的情况下，移动 Home 位置非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:14
#: af2926c5a78b469280271e41f8eae0a0
msgid ""
"The \"EKF origin\" is the location that the EKF (aka AHRS) uses for internal"
" calculations.  This location is normally set to the vehicle's location soon"
" after the GPS provides a good quality location.  Once set the EKF origin "
"cannot be moved.  Users are not normally aware of the EKF origin's location "
"unless they are using Non-GPS navigation on a vehicle with no GPS attached "
"(without a GPS, the user must specify the EKF origin using the ground "
"station)."
msgstr ""
"「EKF 原点」是 EKF（即 AHRS）用于内部计算的位置。该位置通常在 GPS 提供高质量定位后不久设置为飞行器的当前位置。一旦设置，EKF "
"原点不能移动。用户通常不需要关注 EKF 原点的位置，除非在没有 GPS 的飞行器上使用非 GPS 导航（在没有 GPS "
"的情况下，用户必须通过地面站指定 EKF 原点）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:16
#: f3dc50e0db514a11ac610b8842bd5d33
msgid ""
"Whenever the Home or EKF origin is updated the vehicle will send a "
"`HOME_POSITION <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HOME_POSITION>`__"
" or `GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ message "
"(respectively) on all active mavlink channels."
msgstr ""
"每当 Home 位置或 EKF 原点更新时，飞行器将分别在所有活动的 MAVLink 通道上发送 `HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HOME_POSITION>`__ 或 "
"`GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:18
#: e0189e226fbe4b4b872204d97d315cbb
msgid ""
"The home will also be sent in response to a `MAV_CMD_GET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_GET_HOME_POSITION>`__ "
"sent within a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ or `COMMAND_INT"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ message."
msgstr ""
"Home 位置也会在收到 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 或 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ 消息中的 "
"`MAV_CMD_GET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_GET_HOME_POSITION>`__ "
"命令时作为响应发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:23
#: 322eac187a864d9baaf2d6acfff7a045
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME within COMMAND_INT"
msgstr "在 COMMAND_INT 中使用 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:25
#: 213ac24a1f7c45fc941406c864e2db3a
msgid ""
"Set the home location by sending a `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ with the command"
" and parameter fields set as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME>`__ command."
msgstr ""
"通过发送 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ （其中 command "
"和参数字段按照 `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_HOME>`__ "
"命令的规定设置）来设置 Home 位置。"

