#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin.rst:201
#: 398d77a536144c209dd8a254450e4138
msgid ""
"Sets the location used by the EKF/AHRS for internal calculations.  This "
"location is normally automatically set soon after the GPS first returns a "
"good location.  The operator may be required to set this manually if Non-GPS"
" navigation is used.  Once set the EKF origin cannot be moved."
msgstr ""
"设置 EKF/AHRS 用于内部计算的位置。该位置通常在 GPS 首次返回高质量位置后自动设置。若使用非 GPS "
"导航，操作员可能需要手动设置。一旦设置，EKF 原点不能移动。"

